    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to your wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/170addd0a638f7210e7259fd14b7368d.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/170addd0a638f7210e7259fd14b7368d.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/170addd0a638f7210e7259fd14b7368d.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/c382871fdf3b7159ecee0c6fe42e92b2.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;99% sweetness \u00d7 1% surprise&quot;!? A yuri novel game that you'll fall in love with at first sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/38fdb089e8741d55e9eb2400bc44d2df.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/d2aa0b2b0498990d526441d1a2cdf48a.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wheels of fate begin to turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls meet, fall in love, and deepen their bonds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, do you know the meaning of the four-leaf clover?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set at &quot;Shonan Saika Academy,&quot; a prestigious school in Shonan, Kanagawa Prefecture, this is a youthful story of girls wavering between friendship and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/8bf8870a6207f1a16c1438aab497c757.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shonan Saika Academy, a high-achieving all-girls school in Kanagawa Prefecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Marin Tachibana, along with her best friends Mashiro Saotome and Kiyoka Jinguji, experiences a special day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins with meeting an unusual new transfer student, Shizuku Kujyo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful girl with a calm and dignified demeanor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting her feels like d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While showing her around the school, they stop by an observation deck, where Marin finds a four-leaf clover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a tradition at this school: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you press a four-leaf clover found on the observation deck into your student notebook, your wish will come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(I want to get closer to her. To spend more time with her...) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this wish, Marin gives Shizuku the &quot;coincidental&quot; four-leaf clover she found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This act becomes a turning point, bringing Marin and Shizuku closer together with the help of Mashiro and Kiyoka. However... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please, stop worrying about me. I don't want to just be protected...&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shizuku, we're friends, right?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm threatens to tear them apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is deeply tied to a &quot;secret&quot; Shizuku is hiding and a &quot;trauma&quot; from Marin's past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows the growth, mutual support, and cherished memories of the four girls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Marin and the others find their personal &quot;clover&quot; (happiness)?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/b63aab68394830a36cb69895e9fbe3d4.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and healing girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Marin Tachibana (\u7acb\u82b1 \u8309\u9234)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Saho Shirasuna</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *The Detective Is Already Dead* - Charlotte Arisaka Anderson, *Summertime Render* - Mio Kobune, *Blue Archive* - Tsubaki Kasuga, *Atelier Resleriana* - Resna Sternenricht, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/752511bc2e46fbe05a34de57613dea75.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 16 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: March 14</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: O</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's so fun to be with everyone.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reserved and quiet, she has trouble expressing her own opinions. Gentle and warm-hearted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cute, girly demeanor, her friends often dote on her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talented in art, she dreams of attending an art university. Though she is taking lessons from the art club teacher, she's unsure if she should also attend prep school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting Shizuku sparks a change in something within her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool and beautiful girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Shizuku Kujyo (\u4e5d\u6761 \u3057\u305a\u304f)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Yuki Takada</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Aikatsu!* - Rin Kurosawa, *New Game!* - Aoba Suzukaze, *Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid* - Elma, *Idolmaster Cinderella Girls* - Yoshino Yorita, *Honkai: Star Rail* - Tingyun, *Blue Archive* - Midori Saiba, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/f73b839d58d6e3154a32d8e32d44b03c.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 16 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: June 25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;...I'm not good at this kind of thing, but if it's with Marin, then... fine.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perceived as cool and intelligent, but struggles with expressing her emotions, which leads to that impression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined and diligent, she approaches tasks with seriousness and dedication. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she has no fixed plans for her future, she aims to live independently through hard work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After transferring, she harbors complex feelings toward Marin, whom she has just met yet feels strangely familiar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually calm and composed, her emotions become more intense when it comes to Marin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright and cheerful mood-maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mashiro Saotome (\u65e9\u4e59\u5973 \u771f\u767d)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Yuki Kuwahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid* - Doll, *Arifureta: From Commonplace to World's Strongest* - Yue, *The Day I Became a God* - Sora Narukami, *Tokyo 7th Sisters* - Harumi Shinju, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/176f10d32e106780ace9fc4b99831a5f.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: October 31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: AB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Let's all go karaoke! Kiyo-chi, you're coming too, no excuses!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always positive and a cheerful mood-maker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her mere presence energizes those around her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurturing type who can't leave those in need or distress alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams of attending a fashion vocational school after high school but worries about balancing family responsibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Became fast friends with Marin in high school. Mashiro describes Marin as a &quot;delicate beauty who awakens my protective instincts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caring older-sister type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Kiyoka Jinguji (\u795e\u5bae\u5bfa \u6e05\u9999)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Noriko Shibasaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Idolmaster Shiny Colors* - Chiyuki Kuwayama, *Tsugumomo* - Chisato Chikami, *Arifureta: From Commonplace to World's Strongest* - Liliana S. B. Heiligh, *Cinderella Nine in August* - Shizuku Tsukahara, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e3d6bd5da743888ee18cd0a14920be84.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: April 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's violin practice day, so I'm heading home now.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A natural leader who excels academically and athletically. With her broad perspective, she often appears wise beyond her years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she seems strict, her endearing traits, like a fear of bugs or ghosts, occasionally surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves music and dreams of becoming a composer, though her parents oppose the idea. Determined to convince them, she works hard to achieve her goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Childhood friends with Mashiro, whom she views as a younger sister and has always protected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admired as an older-sister figure, though she isn't fully aware of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/88aa33603d9fe353175af62ac9f40992.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Character Expressions System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express characters' emotions in greater variety! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/1b75104fa6cdfe13041b0e7dd3f00861.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project &amp; Concept: vividX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Design &amp; Original Art: Kukiha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario: Mao Kahoku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Art: Wayu Kaneko / Cheeser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design: Yunoki Hanamori</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music: Shoichiro Toko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/4f7d38649ed76cdeeb4fa5c98a1e1e9b.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Clover Reset&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music, Lyrics, Arrangement: Shoichiro Toko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocals: Saho Shirasuna (as Marin Tachibana)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/c382871fdf3b7159ecee0c6fe42e92b2.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;99% sweetness \u00d7 1% surprise&quot;!? A yuri novel game that you'll fall in love with at first sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/38fdb089e8741d55e9eb2400bc44d2df.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/d2aa0b2b0498990d526441d1a2cdf48a.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wheels of fate begin to turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls meet, fall in love, and deepen their bonds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, do you know the meaning of the four-leaf clover?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set at &quot;Shonan Saika Academy,&quot; a prestigious school in Shonan, Kanagawa Prefecture, this is a youthful story of girls wavering between friendship and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/8bf8870a6207f1a16c1438aab497c757.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shonan Saika Academy, a high-achieving all-girls school in Kanagawa Prefecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Marin Tachibana, along with her best friends Mashiro Saotome and Kiyoka Jinguji, experiences a special day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins with meeting an unusual new transfer student, Shizuku Kujyo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful girl with a calm and dignified demeanor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting her feels like d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While showing her around the school, they stop by an observation deck, where Marin finds a four-leaf clover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a tradition at this school: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you press a four-leaf clover found on the observation deck into your student notebook, your wish will come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(I want to get closer to her. To spend more time with her...) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this wish, Marin gives Shizuku the &quot;coincidental&quot; four-leaf clover she found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This act becomes a turning point, bringing Marin and Shizuku closer together with the help of Mashiro and Kiyoka. However... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please, stop worrying about me. I don't want to just be protected...&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shizuku, we're friends, right?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm threatens to tear them apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is deeply tied to a &quot;secret&quot; Shizuku is hiding and a &quot;trauma&quot; from Marin's past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows the growth, mutual support, and cherished memories of the four girls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Marin and the others find their personal &quot;clover&quot; (happiness)?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/b63aab68394830a36cb69895e9fbe3d4.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and healing girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Marin Tachibana (\u7acb\u82b1 \u8309\u9234)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Saho Shirasuna</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *The Detective Is Already Dead* - Charlotte Arisaka Anderson, *Summertime Render* - Mio Kobune, *Blue Archive* - Tsubaki Kasuga, *Atelier Resleriana* - Resna Sternenricht, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/752511bc2e46fbe05a34de57613dea75.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 16 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: March 14</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: O</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's so fun to be with everyone.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reserved and quiet, she has trouble expressing her own opinions. Gentle and warm-hearted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cute, girly demeanor, her friends often dote on her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talented in art, she dreams of attending an art university. Though she is taking lessons from the art club teacher, she's unsure if she should also attend prep school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting Shizuku sparks a change in something within her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool and beautiful girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Shizuku Kujyo (\u4e5d\u6761 \u3057\u305a\u304f)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Yuki Takada</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Aikatsu!* - Rin Kurosawa, *New Game!* - Aoba Suzukaze, *Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid* - Elma, *Idolmaster Cinderella Girls* - Yoshino Yorita, *Honkai: Star Rail* - Tingyun, *Blue Archive* - Midori Saiba, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/f73b839d58d6e3154a32d8e32d44b03c.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 16 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: June 25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;...I'm not good at this kind of thing, but if it's with Marin, then... fine.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perceived as cool and intelligent, but struggles with expressing her emotions, which leads to that impression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined and diligent, she approaches tasks with seriousness and dedication. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she has no fixed plans for her future, she aims to live independently through hard work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After transferring, she harbors complex feelings toward Marin, whom she has just met yet feels strangely familiar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually calm and composed, her emotions become more intense when it comes to Marin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright and cheerful mood-maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mashiro Saotome (\u65e9\u4e59\u5973 \u771f\u767d)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Yuki Kuwahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid* - Doll, *Arifureta: From Commonplace to World's Strongest* - Yue, *The Day I Became a God* - Sora Narukami, *Tokyo 7th Sisters* - Harumi Shinju, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/176f10d32e106780ace9fc4b99831a5f.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: October 31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: AB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Let's all go karaoke! Kiyo-chi, you're coming too, no excuses!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always positive and a cheerful mood-maker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her mere presence energizes those around her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurturing type who can't leave those in need or distress alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams of attending a fashion vocational school after high school but worries about balancing family responsibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Became fast friends with Marin in high school. Mashiro describes Marin as a &quot;delicate beauty who awakens my protective instincts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667\u2667</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caring older-sister type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Kiyoka Jinguji (\u795e\u5bae\u5bfa \u6e05\u9999)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Noriko Shibasaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Featured in: *Idolmaster Shiny Colors* - Chiyuki Kuwayama, *Tsugumomo* - Chisato Chikami, *Arifureta: From Commonplace to World's Strongest* - Liliana S. B. Heiligh, *Cinderella Nine in August* - Shizuku Tsukahara, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e3d6bd5da743888ee18cd0a14920be84.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17 (at the time of appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: April 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Type: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's violin practice day, so I'm heading home now.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A natural leader who excels academically and athletically. With her broad perspective, she often appears wise beyond her years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she seems strict, her endearing traits, like a fear of bugs or ghosts, occasionally surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves music and dreams of becoming a composer, though her parents oppose the idea. Determined to convince them, she works hard to achieve her goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Childhood friends with Mashiro, whom she views as a younger sister and has always protected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admired as an older-sister figure, though she isn't fully aware of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/88aa33603d9fe353175af62ac9f40992.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Character Expressions System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/5b666a765a1479e5f84edf62b170e035.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/e672b3143b607c205217f1c31fe8bf7c.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/138ac138035352a5347037b52085210a.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.poster.avif?t=1748602026\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.webm?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/2b4daa2e5172a3a13ad78ed556b35657.mp4?t=1748602026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express characters' emotions in greater variety! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/1b75104fa6cdfe13041b0e7dd3f00861.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project &amp; Concept: vividX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Design &amp; Original Art: Kukiha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario: Mao Kahoku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Art: Wayu Kaneko / Cheeser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design: Yunoki Hanamori</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music: Shoichiro Toko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239250/extras/4f7d38649ed76cdeeb4fa5c98a1e1e9b.avif?t=1748602026\" data-has-big width=800 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Clover Reset&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music, Lyrics, Arrangement: Shoichiro Toko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocals: Saho Shirasuna (as Marin Tachibana)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
